My particular area when I'm looking outside of the universal like psychological first aid is parent-child interaction therapy or PCIT. It is magic. It truly is the most magical treatment on the face of the planet. And I can say that because I've got the mic. PCIT has more than 400 scientific journal articles, book chapters, randomized trials on its effectiveness. And we know from many of those studies that it is extremely effective for children who have experienced trauma. Now recently, I've been working with a colleague, Dr. Christina Warner Metzger, another wonderful psychologist to create a trauma module specific to PCIT, to give parents skills and ideas and
