They came back, started up again, had to put a pin in it, floods, came back, started again, COVID. Oh, Lord. So then you start saying, you can't really talk about what's doing what? And what we've learned is this is not unusual. We have done several other places, not as bad as New South Wales, but we're collecting information, and sure enough, they come in with one trauma, and halfway through, we look again, and the majority of kids have had another trauma.
