00:27:11.000 --> 00:27:44.000
So if you are in the mental health field, please seek out training in disaster mental health, what that is like and how you can support survivors after disasters. And disasters is any event that overwhelms an ability for us to cope. So they can be natural terrorism. They can be man-made. they can be whatever. But we've come a long way. There are many, many more treatments across the age span. There are many, many more providers that truly do understand this.
因此，如果你身处心理健康领域，请寻求灾难心理健康方面的培训，了解那是什么样的，以及如何在灾难发生后支持幸存者。灾难是指任何压倒我们应对能力的事件。所以它们可以是自然灾害、恐怖主义。它们可以是人造的。它们可以是任何东西。但我们已经走过了很长的路。跨年龄段的治疗方法已经多得多。有更多、更多的提供者真正理解这一点。

